  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NICFI26-28 - ACA - Indigenous and Civil Society Leadership to Stop Amazo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to reduce transnational forest crimes: illegal mining, logging, land grabbing, illicit cultivation in in three Amazonian countries (Bolivia, Ecuador and Peru). In addition it has a regional component.</narrative>
  </description>
